# Petição Pública Data Extractor (Browser Snippet)

A lightweight, zero-dependency browser console snippet designed to extract petition data (Title, Full Link, and Signature Count) directly from `peticaopublica.com` search results into your system clipboard as formatted CSV data.

Because the extraction runs inside your own active browser session, it natively bypasses anti-bot measures (such as Cloudflare Turnstile and JS challenges) and handles Portuguese special characters (`é`, `ã`, `ç`) without encoding errors.

---

## Features

- **Cloudflare Bypass:** Runs inside your authenticated browser context.
- **Direct to Clipboard:** Copies extracted rows straight to your clipboard to bypass browser-blocked file downloads.
- **Accurate Extraction:** Pulls petition titles, absolute URLs, and exact signature counts using native DOM selectors.
- **No Dependencies:** No Python, Node.js, or external extensions required.

---

## How to Use

### 1. Perform Your Search
Navigate to any search results page on [peticaopublica.com](https://peticaopublica.com), for example:
`https://peticaopublica.com/search.aspx?q=género&pg=1`

### 2. Open Developer Tools
Open your browser's Developer Tools Console:
- **Windows/Linux:** Press `F12` or `Ctrl + Shift + I`
- **Mac:** Press `Cmd + Option + I`
- Or right-click anywhere on the page and select **Inspect** $\rightarrow$ **Console**.

*(Note: If Chrome shows a warning about pasting, type `allow pasting` into the console and press Enter).*

### 3. Run the Snippet
Paste the following JavaScript code into the console and press **Enter**:

```javascript
(() => {
  const rows = [["Title", "Link", "Signatures"]];
  
  // Target petition entries on the page
  document.querySelectorAll('li.petResult').forEach(item => {
    const titleLink = item.querySelector('.title a');
    if (!titleLink) return;
    
    // Format Title and Link
    const title = titleLink.innerText.trim().replace(/\s+/g, ' ').replace(/"/g, '""');
    const href = titleLink.getAttribute('href');
    const fullLink = href.startsWith('http') ? href : `[https://peticaopublica.com](https://peticaopublica.com)${href}`;
    
    // Extract Signature Count
    const sigText = item.querySelector('.body p:last-child')?.innerText || "N/A";
    const sigMatch = sigText.match(/\d+/);
    const signatures = sigMatch ? sigMatch[0] : "0";

    rows.push([`"${title}"`, `"${fullLink}"`, `"${signatures}"`]);
  });

  if (rows.length <= 1) {
    console.error("No petResult items found on this page.");
    return;
  }

  // Convert to CSV text format
  const csvText = rows.map(e => e.join(",")).join("\n");

  // Copy directly to system clipboard
  copy(csvText);

  const pgMatch = window.location.href.match(/pg=(\d+)/);
  const pageNum = pgMatch ? pgMatch[1] : "1";

  console.log(`%c Success! Extracted ${rows.length - 1} items from Page ${pageNum} and copied to clipboard!`, 'color: #00ff00; font-weight: bold;');
  console.log("Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V) in Excel, Google Sheets, or Notepad to paste.");
})();
